From c9d1adbb5693d139c962f903fc8a6175f687963f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 01:33:31 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] mempool(v2): avoid repeated parent and overlay work
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Extract this concern so its mechanism can be reviewed and measured independently.
No source semantics are added or removed by this history operation.

Original patch rationale (describes the unsplit source, not every extracted part):
Extract 36-byte Outpoints directly in ParseNodeFast during authenticated internal
tree walks, eliminate unchanged-sibling DB reads at non-collapsing depths in EraseAt,
and wire one-wave V2 PreChecksBatch and pre-cs_main outpoint/sighash readahead.

Original-Commit: 6b77f6b3eaa39d56184e29082fb069af38b70f4a
Original-Patch: v2/029
Split-Concern: parents

Historical compilation prerequisites are tracked separately in daemon/patch-audit;
this provenance-preserving split does not imply standalone build validation.

Candidate-Application-Repair: Retain original native per-input batch-parent index optimization and empty-pool shortcut, adapting its signature alongside the already-owned known-parent span API. Keep shared snapshot/filter tracking; no parent or overlay algorithm disabled.

Plan-v2 owner repair: C native context: preserve one-pass admission and local-origin trickle; retain native transaction/header and prefetch semantics.

(cherry picked from commit da96477254cf58549a9441f1a6b7a9663413593a)

Canonical-Source-Commit: da96477254cf58549a9441f1a6b7a9663413593a

Coordinator integration provenance (network403):
Resolve integration context by retaining the incoming purposeful change together with existing shared/native consumers; exact old/new patch and file inventory is retained in owner-adaptations.json. No authored purpose or removed downstream behavior restored.
Original scripted commands/hashes above are original-author provenance; modified parent/tool/catalog hashes are not claimed to reproduce this composition. Exact coordinator adaptation scripts and ordered tree proof are in composed403-network-metrics-delivery. Build/runtime/benchmarks NOT_RUN for this composition under user compile-first policy.

Coordinator historical implementation recovery (2026-10-21):
Deduplicate the previously recovered shared base_self reuse against this owner’s existing native implementation; keep every original native dirty guard, reset and optimization.

Coordinator historical decoder recovery (2026-10-21):
Deduplicate the shared unsorted UTXO gathering recovery against this existing native implementation. All native hashing thresholds and algorithm guards remain as originally maintained.
